WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.334 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You are obviously
very accomplished.

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:04.170 align:start size:94% position:6%
Your sister
is a climate scientist.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:04.637 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-She is.

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.239
-Which is a very cool job
and one we need more of.

00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:08.441 size:84% position:42%
-Yeah, she's amazing.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:12.379
-And she was invited --
this is her right here...

00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:13.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's her.
-...to be a guest

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:15.048 align:start size:94% position:6%
at Michelle Obama's...
-At the State of the Union.

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:16.349 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...at Obama's State of
the Union by Michelle Obama.

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:17.817
-Yeah, Michelle --
she was Michelle Obama's guest.

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:19.719 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, she's --
she works particularly

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:22.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
with, like, you know,
how climate change affects

00:00:22.222 --> 00:00:25.725
low-income and Latino
communities and people of color

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:28.161 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause they're
disproportionately affected

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:29.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
by the things --
there's no infrastructure.

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:33.033
So she goes around the --
around the country talking

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:36.469
and -- and, you know, educating
people about what's going on.

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:38.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's incredible.
She really stole my thunder.

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
-That -- That is --

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:40.540 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was going to ask.
-Yeah.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:41.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
-'Cause if you -- yeah.
-Yeah.

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.843 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Deservedly --
-Nicole Hernandez Hammer --

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:45.545 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's her name --
Nicole Hernandez Hammer.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:47.514 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Have you --
Have you ever been invited

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:48.748 line:92%
to the State of the Union?

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:49.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No.
-No.

00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:51.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ever met --
have you met the Obamas?

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:53.086 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Maybe this year.
-Yeah. [ Laughs ]

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:55.588 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Met the Obamas?

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:56.556 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-No, but I met Malia.

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:58.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay. That counts, yeah.
-Yes, yes, yes.

00:00:58.558 --> 00:00:59.325 line:92%
She was -- 'cause she's --

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:03.063 align:start size:94% position:6%
She was doing an internship
at a costume facility.

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:04.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-And I -- And I was there.

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:06.332
-And I remember I walked by her
like I knew her.

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:08.334
I was like -- 'cause I thought
she was someone that I knew.

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:10.136
And I was like, "Ah, I can't
remember where I know her from."

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:12.806 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "Oh,
that's where I know her from."

00:01:12.806 --> 00:01:14.307 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
And I came back out.

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:14.974 size:88% position:44% line:92%
And I even said, "Sorry.

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:16.109 align:start size:94% position:6%
I kind of acted
like I knew you already."

00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:17.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
She was like, "No, I know."
She was like,

00:01:17.944 --> 00:01:19.412 align:start size:94% position:6%
"But, you know, my dad
really loved 'Ex Machina.'"

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:20.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow!
-I said, "Really? Wow. Cool."

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:22.549 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's a good thing to hear.
I like that movie, too.

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:24.117 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah.
-He and I are very similar.

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:25.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, you guys are...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:26.152 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Intellectually.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:27.253 size:78% position:39%
-I think we're, like,
very intellectual.

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:29.155 align:start size:94% position:6%
The same tastes and stuff.
-I can tell, yeah.

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:29.689 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:32.492
-You finished -- You finished
filming the ninth "Star Wars."

00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:33.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's done?
-All done, yes.

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:34.994 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How very exciting.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:38.098 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, finished.
-Are you --

00:01:38.098 --> 00:01:41.000 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm just curious because,
you know, obviously,

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.902 align:start size:94% position:6%
those films
are very intense and --

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:44.104 line:92%
and there are giant budgets,

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:45.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
and there's
an expectation for them.

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:48.341
What do you -- When you're,
like, in between shooting,

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:50.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
what are you doing to --
to stay calm

00:01:50.143 --> 00:01:52.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
or -- or to --
to just relax?

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:56.015 size:84% position:42%
-In between shooting --
you know, I don't know.

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:58.618 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's -- It's funny
'cause you -- you do get --

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:00.320 align:start size:94% position:6%
like,
we're such adaptable creatures

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:02.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
that even the craziest
of situations

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:03.857 align:start size:94% position:6%
start to feel so routine.
-Sure.

00:02:03.857 --> 00:02:04.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know?
It's like,

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:07.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I got to squeeze back in
this Millennium Falcon again."

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:08.128 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:09.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like, "This is not made
for ethnic people."

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:14.267 size:88% position:44%
This is -- Solo had very
slender hips, didn't he?

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:15.368 line:92%
So, you know, it's funny.

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:17.971
You know, but -- but
by the end of it, it really was,

00:02:17.971 --> 00:02:21.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, the emotion of the whole
thing finally being over.

00:02:21.508 --> 00:02:22.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-You know?

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:24.210 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that --
that was just unbelievable.

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:25.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean,
not only these three movies,

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:27.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
but the whole Skywalker saga.
-It's crazy.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:28.882 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Yeah, an amazing thing.

00:02:28.882 --> 00:02:30.283
I'm so happy
you ended up being a part of it.

00:02:30.283 --> 00:02:31.684
It was fantastic. And it's
always so great to see you.

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:33.086
-Yeah, good to see you, too.
-Thank you for coming back.

00:02:33.086 --> 00:02:35.555 size:84% position:42%
Really appreciate it.
[ Cheers and applause ]

